  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Center for Global Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to improve the effectiveness of bilateral official development providers&#x2019; cooperation and development finance, including the European Union, in a rapidly evolving geopolitical landscape.  Work under this partnership will be delivered by: (1) conducting policy-relevant research and comparative analysis to create a body of work that is evidence-based, responsive to, and representative of, the policy needs and issues related to future-proofing development cooperation and European development finance; and (2) strategic convenings and events, bringing together and engaging with a network of relevant stakeholders to facilitate discussions, peer learning, and ensuring that CGD Europe&#x2019;s research is informed by different perspectives and political realities. Further details about the research themes and specific deliverables are provided in section 3.</narrative>
  </description>
